      ],
      "source": "https://legendsofkansas.com/devon-kansas/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A post office opened on February 26, 1889, with Wiley Bolinger as its first postmaster.",
